6
00:00:21,940 --> 00:00:22,760
Saintsy, sis.

7
00:00:22,900 --> 00:00:24,660
We only have two weeks to prepare,

8
00:00:24,840 --> 00:00:26,620
so focus, find your strengths fast,

9
00:00:26,700 --> 00:00:28,020
and be sure to work as a team.

10
00:00:28,080 --> 00:00:28,940
Yes, ma'am!

11
00:00:28,940 --> 00:00:30,820
