23
00:00:55,720 --> 00:00:58,580
If we fail to follow the rules,

24
00:00:58,720 --> 00:01:00,440
points will be subtracted from our total.

25
00:01:00,820 --> 00:01:02,460
So you'll really have to use your hats

26
