Wait, really?

38
00:01:25,160 --> 00:01:26,820
I didn't know our school did that.

39
00:01:26,960 --> 00:01:29,600
I think of it as our yearly dose of glamour and charm.

40
00:01:29,800 --> 00:01:31,000
It's always a highlight.

41
00:01:31,640 --> 00:01:34,440
Whoever places first in the pageant wins special points

42
00:01:34,440 --> 00:01:36,780
