Excuse me? Did something happen to you?

171
00:06:53,920 --> 00:07:00,920
I'm fine. I've just been busy dealing with patrons. I haven't had any time to eat.

172
00:07:00,920 --> 00:07:04,920
Well, I'm not going to stand here and let you starve.

173
00:07:04,920 --> 00:07:09,920
I know it might not be to your taste, but you're welcome to have my lunch!

174
00:07:09,920 --> 00:07:14,920
Uh, thank you.

175
00:07:14,920 --> 00:07:16,920
