182
00:07:40,920 --> 00:07:44,920
She's our student council president, Rei Kogami!

183
00:07:44,920 --> 00:07:49,920
She's gorgeous, gets amazing grades, and excels in sports!

184
00:07:49,920 --> 00:07:51,920
Not only is she perfect, but she's kind!

185
00:07:51,920 --> 00:07:54,920
She's so awesome, she has an official fan club! Gosh!

186
00:07:54,920 --> 00:07:57,920
