197
00:08:54,920 --> 00:09:10,920
Koyomi.

198
00:09:10,920 --> 00:09:14,920
Thank you for this morning.

199
00:09:14,920 --> 00:09:17,920
I so appreciate your help.

200
00:09:17,920 --> 00:09:27,920
Your bento was delicious.

201
00:09:27,920 --> 00:09:31,920
Truth is, both my parents passed away.

202
00:09:31,920 --> 00:09:34,920
My older brother works as a host to make ends meet.

203
00:09:34,920 --> 00:09:36,920
I went by his job to drop something off.

204
00:09:36,920 --> 00:09:39,920
They were desperate for more hosts, so they threw me in a wig and a suit.

205
00:09:39,920 --> 00:09:41,920
Now I work there part time.

206
00:09:41,920 --> 00:09:44,920
You saw me, so I thought you should know.

207
00:09:44,920 --> 00:09:46,920
But I ask that you keep it between us.

208
00:09:46,920 --> 00:09:49,920
She-she-she's unbelievable!

209
00:09:49,920 --> 00:09:52,920
Not only is she the beloved student council president, Ray!

210
00:09:52,920 --> 00:09:56,920
She's the number one employee at the Free Boat Rose Club!

211
00:09:56,920 --> 00:09:58,920
The handsome Ray!

212
00:09:58,920 --> 00:10:01,920
Ignore those other guys. Only look at me.

213
00:10:01,920 --> 00:10:04,920
Forget about Ray. I'm right here.

214
00:10:04,920 --> 00:10:07,920
Come sit on my lap, little kitten.

215
00:10:07,920 --> 00:10:11,920
You're my girl now. Best not forget it.

216
00:10:11,920 --> 00:10:14,920
The tension between you and I is undeniable.

217
00:10:14,920 --> 00:10:16,920
Tell them who's your daddy.

218
00:10:16,920 --> 00:10:20,920
How could a regular girl end up part of a host club love heptagon?

219
00:10:20,920 --> 00:10:23,920
What in the world is going to happen to me next?

220
00:10:23,920 --> 00:10:24,920
I'm fixed!

221
00:10:29,920 --> 00:10:31,920
Amazing job at work today.

222
00:10:31,920 --> 00:10:33,920
I made this if you're hungry.

223
00:10:33,920 --> 00:10:34,920
Thanks so much.

224
00:10:34,920 --> 00:10:36,920
Sweet of you to think of me.

225
00:10:39,920 --> 00:10:42,920
A lot of other girls will put trendy spins on their bentos.

226
00:10:42,920 --> 00:10:44,920
But your cooking is just so...

227
00:10:44,920 --> 00:10:46,920
It's so dull, isn't it?

228
00:10:46,920 --> 00:10:47,920
I'm sorry.

229
00:10:47,920 --> 00:10:49,920
I've seen them.

230
00:10:49,920 --> 00:10:53,920
The super cute bentos you get from the girls in your fan club.

231
00:10:53,920 --> 00:10:55,920
Koyami, what are you saying?

232
00:10:55,920 --> 00:10:59,920
You're used to eating high quality food at fancy restaurants with your patrons.

233
00:10:59,920 --> 00:11:02,920
Ray has to be nice to everyone she meets.

234
00:11:02,920 --> 00:11:05,920
Being friendly is part of her job.

235
00:11:07,920 --> 00:11:10,920
Just because she's kind to me doesn't mean I'm special to her.

236
00:11:12,920 --> 00:11:15,920
I can't believe I was foolish enough to get the wrong idea.

237
00:11:17,920 --> 00:11:20,920
Your bentos are classic.

238
00:11:20,920 --> 00:11:23,920
They remind me of what my mother used to make.

239
00:11:23,920 --> 00:11:25,920
It puts me at ease.

240
00:11:29,920 --> 00:11:34,920
Between school and work, I'm always so tense, always on edge.

241
00:11:36,920 --> 00:11:40,920
But once I finally clock out and get to spend time with her,

242
00:11:40,920 --> 00:11:42,920
