243
00:11:42,920 --> 00:11:46,920
We've gotten so close because you know that I'm a host.

244
00:11:46,920 --> 00:11:50,920
But it's because I'm a host that you won't believe me.

245
00:11:51,920 --> 00:11:54,920
No matter what I say, or how I feel.

246
00:12:01,920 --> 00:12:02,920
Ray-sama?

247
00:12:03,920 --> 00:12:04,920
I know, right?

248
00:12:04,920 --> 00:12:05,920
It totally wrecks your heart.

249
00:12:05,920 --> 00:12:08,920
Now do you understand why everyone falls for her?

250
00:12:08,920 --> 00:12:09,920
Yeah.

251
00:12:09,920 --> 00:12:11,920
Really makes me want Ray to find happiness.

252
00:12:11,920 --> 00:12:12,920
Yeah, exactly!

253
00:12:13,920 --> 00:12:16,920
I really appreciate the fact that Ray isn't just cool cause she's pretty,

254
