268
00:12:56,920 --> 00:13:00,920
All of Ray's patrons are perfectly aware that she's a woman.

269
00:13:00,920 --> 00:13:02,920
And even so, they come to see her.

270
00:13:02,920 --> 00:13:04,920
Ray does not show us lies.

271
00:13:04,920 --> 00:13:06,920
She shows us dreams.

272
00:13:06,920 --> 00:13:10,920
Dreams so beautiful that ideas like sex and gender cease to matter.

273
00:13:10,920 --> 00:13:12,920
Ray's who we want.

274
00:13:12,920 --> 00:13:15,920
Who we need in a world full of miserable men like the three of you.

275
00:13:15,920 --> 00:13:21,920
If it means I can help Ray shine, I couldn't care less if I'm not the star.

276
00:13:21,920 --> 00:13:25,920
In order to remain at Ray's side, I'll continue to be her ace.

277
00:13:26,920 --> 00:13:28,920
That's my greatest satisfaction.

278
00:13:28,920 --> 00:13:33,920
You could say Tokiko Sumugi is the manlier of the two at that speech of hers!

279
00:13:33,920 --> 00:13:34,920
I couldn't agree more.

280
00:13:34,920 --> 00:13:39,920
Okay, for this one, we're going to need to make a complete outfit like a three-piece suit.

281
00:13:39,920 --> 00:13:42,920
For the makeup, I want to express an androgynous beauty.

282
00:13:42,920 --> 00:13:44,920
We'll need to slim out your face a bit.

283
00:13:44,920 --> 00:13:47,920
As well as thicken your eyebrows a touch without going overboard.

284
00:13:47,920 --> 00:13:50,920
Finally, we'll make your eyes pop by using reserved colors.

285
00:13:50,920 --> 00:13:52,920
Oakley doakley!

286
00:13:52,920 --> 00:13:53,920
Also...

287
00:13:53,920 --> 00:13:54,920
The rainbow rose.

288
00:13:54,920 --> 00:13:56,920
A flower shop perhaps has one.

289
00:13:56,920 --> 00:13:57,920
For sure.

290
00:13:57,920 --> 00:14:00,920
It's just that depending on which shop you go to,

291
00:14:00,920 --> 00:14:04,920
an actual rainbow rose could probably run you around a thousand yen apiece.

292
00:14:04,920 --> 00:14:06,920
That much for one rose?

293
00:14:06,920 --> 00:14:07,920
How about this?

294
00:14:07,920 --> 00:14:10,920
We get an artificial rose for cheap and we spray paint it to be rainbow.

295
00:14:10,920 --> 00:14:12,920
Oh! Sweet!

296
00:14:12,920 --> 00:14:14,920
Also, isn't Rei like super tall?

297
00:14:14,920 --> 00:14:16,920
We can use insoles and boost my height.

298
00:14:16,920 --> 00:14:17,920
It's perfect!

299
00:14:17,920 --> 00:14:21,920
And the fabric we used for Nihon's course, it would be amazeables!

300
00:14:21,920 --> 00:14:24,920
It's got total number one host vibes, don't you think?

301
00:14:24,920 --> 00:14:28,920
If she were a normal number one host, I would have considered using it.

302
00:14:28,920 --> 00:14:30,920
It would totally pop, right?

303
00:14:30,920 --> 00:14:31,920
Wait, what?

304
00:14:31,920 --> 00:14:33,920
While it's an elegant fabric, that's for sure.

305
00:14:33,920 --> 00:14:37,920
I don't think it's quite right for the number one host, Rei, you know?

306
00:14:37,920 --> 00:14:38,920
I mean, sure.

307
00:14:38,920 --> 00:14:42,920
Rei-sama stands out because of her looks, but in reality, she's pretty reserved.

308
00:14:42,920 --> 00:14:46,920
She only became student council president and a host because she was asked to.

309
00:14:46,920 --> 00:14:48,920
She didn't seek it out on her own.

310
00:14:48,920 --> 00:14:52,920
So for the suit fabric, I don't think going flashy is quite the right direction.

311
00:14:52,920 --> 00:14:53,920
Not here, at least.

312
00:14:53,920 --> 00:14:54,920
So true, bestie!

313
00:14:54,920 --> 00:14:59,920
Although the club owner does get on her case a lot about dressing more like a number one host,

314
00:14:59,920 --> 00:15:03,920
so I definitely think embossing this shirt is the right way to go for this cosplay.

315
00:15:03,920 --> 00:15:08,920
Looking at the designs from the series got me curious about how all of the suits look so slim fit.

316
00:15:08,920 --> 00:15:11,920
At first I thought that was just how they were depicted in shoujo manga,

317
00:15:11,920 --> 00:15:14,920
but they're trimmed differently from business suits.

318
00:15:14,920 --> 00:15:16,920
It's supposed to make the wearer look cooler.

319
00:15:16,920 --> 00:15:17,920
Whoa, is that true?

320
00:15:17,920 --> 00:15:19,920
Your curves will be obvious though,

321
00:15:19,920 --> 00:15:23,920
so it might be kind of difficult to replicate a straighter, manlier body type.

322
00:15:23,920 --> 00:15:26,920
Ah, gotcha.

323
00:15:26,920 --> 00:15:30,920
I promise I'll still do everything in my power to make it work.

324
00:15:30,920 --> 00:15:33,920
But the thing is, your waist is pretty thin.

325
00:15:33,920 --> 00:15:36,920
So there's a chance you wouldn't make a convincing guy.

326
00:15:36,920 --> 00:15:38,920
Then again...

327
00:15:38,920 --> 00:15:40,920
Of course.

328
00:15:40,920 --> 00:15:42,920
I guess it makes sense.

329
00:15:42,920 --> 00:15:45,920
With all the cosplays we've done together,

330
00:15:45,920 --> 00:15:48,920
Gojo has all my measurements memorized.

331
00:15:48,920 --> 00:15:52,920
That's... a little bit...

332
00:15:52,920 --> 00:15:55,920
So what's your opinion on it?

333
00:15:55,920 --> 00:15:56,920
Wait, what now?!

334
00:15:56,920 --> 00:15:58,920
Oh yeah, we've so got this!

335
00:15:58,920 --> 00:16:00,920
There's still two weeks till the cultural festival!

336
00:16:00,920 --> 00:16:01,920
Oh...

337
00:16:01,920 --> 00:16:02,920
Well, uh...

338
00:16:02,920 --> 00:16:03,920
Hmm?

339
00:16:03,920 --> 00:16:06,920
Since you're the one entering the beauty pageant,

340
00:16:06,920 --> 00:16:09,920
you'll be able to spend all of your time working on your outfit.

341
00:16:09,920 --> 00:16:10,920
Hmm...

342
00:16:10,920 --> 00:16:14,920
But I'm on interior design duty and will likely be pretty busy.

343
00:16:14,920 --> 00:16:15,920
Uh...

344
00:16:15,920 --> 00:16:18,920
So if I can only work on this after interior design,

345
00:16:18,920 --> 00:16:22,920
I'll have even less time than I did with Shizuku-tan!

346
00:16:22,920 --> 00:16:24,920
Uh...

347
00:16:24,920 --> 00:16:26,920
So this is gonna be rough, huh?

348
00:16:26,920 --> 00:16:27,920
Uh...

349
00:16:27,920 --> 00:16:38,920
Hey...

350
00:16:38,920 --> 00:16:39,920
Huh?

351
00:16:39,920 --> 00:16:41,920
About the Rei cosplay...

352
00:16:41,920 --> 00:16:44,920
I'll put it together myself, okay?

353
00:16:44,920 --> 00:16:46,920
Alright...

354
00:16:46,920 --> 00:16:47,920
Easy enough.

355
00:16:47,920 --> 00:16:50,920
I'll just head out and grab all of this.

356
00:16:50,920 --> 00:16:52,920
If you don't know what something is, just call me.

357
00:16:52,920 --> 00:16:54,920
Also while you're there, talk to Mr. Usami.

358
00:16:54,920 --> 00:16:56,920
He'll definitely be able to help you out.

359
00:16:56,920 --> 00:16:57,920
Gotcha!

360
00:16:57,920 --> 00:16:59,920
I'll draft up instructions on how to make the outfit,

361
00:16:59,920 --> 00:17:00,920
but Kitagawa...

362
00:17:00,920 --> 00:17:02,920
Will you really be okay?

363
00:17:02,920 --> 00:17:03,920
Yeah!

364
00:17:03,920 --> 00:17:04,920
It'll be no biggie!

365
00:17:04,920 --> 00:17:06,920
I can absolutely pull this off,

366
00:17:06,920 --> 00:17:08,920
so don't you worry about a thing!

367
00:17:08,920 --> 00:17:09,920
I'm worrying...

368
00:17:13,920 --> 00:17:15,920
Usually shopping is a ton of fun,

369
00:17:15,920 --> 00:17:18,920
because it means I'm getting ready for another cosplay.

370
00:17:18,920 --> 00:17:19,920
But...

371
00:17:22,920 --> 00:17:24,920
Without Gojo around...

372
00:17:24,920 --> 00:17:26,920
I'm freaking out!

373
00:17:28,920 --> 00:17:31,920
I have to make sure I don't buy the wrong stuff!

374
00:17:31,920 --> 00:17:34,920
I'm winning first place, so I've gotta work hard!

375
00:17:35,920 --> 00:17:37,920
Worst case scenario...

376
00:17:37,920 --> 00:17:39,920
I just work day one of the cultural festival,

377
00:17:39,920 --> 00:17:42,920
and somehow make it to the beauty pageant on day two.

378
00:17:43,920 --> 00:17:45,920
I'll need to do the interior design,

379
00:17:45,920 --> 00:17:48,920
the instructions for the outfit, and...

380
00:17:50,920 --> 00:17:53,920
It'll be okay, if I just believe I can do it.

381
00:17:54,920 --> 00:17:55,920
Except...

382
00:17:56,920 --> 00:17:58,920
I have to manage my time properly.

383
00:18:01,920 --> 00:18:04,920
So that I don't end up burdening anybody else.

384
00:18:07,920 --> 00:18:08,920
Okay...

385
00:18:08,920 --> 00:18:09,920
Listen up!

386
00:18:10,920 --> 00:18:11,920
Uh...

387
00:18:19,920 --> 00:18:20,920
Gojo...

388
00:18:20,920 --> 00:18:21,920
Is something wrong?

389
00:18:21,920 --> 00:18:22,920
What are you doing here?

390
00:18:22,920 --> 00:18:23,920
I...

391
00:18:24,920 --> 00:18:25,920
Uh...

392
00:18:25,920 --> 00:18:27,920
Thought I'd help with interior design.

393
00:18:27,920 --> 00:18:28,920
Huh?

394
00:18:28,920 --> 00:18:29,920
Really?

395
00:18:29,920 --> 00:18:30,920
Dude, we got all that covered.

396
00:18:33,920 --> 00:18:35,920
You need to make the pageant outfit, right?

397
00:18:38,920 --> 00:18:39,920
Huh?

398
00:18:39,920 --> 00:18:41,920
Bro, I'm the one who's confused right now.

399
00:18:41,920 --> 00:18:43,920
Aren't you making Kitagawa's outfit?

400
00:18:44,920 --> 00:18:45,920
That's what I thought, too.

401
00:18:45,920 --> 00:18:46,920
Did I misremember?

402
00:18:46,920 --> 00:18:47,920
I thought so, too.

403
00:18:47,920 --> 00:18:48,920
Guess we were wrong.

404
00:18:48,920 --> 00:18:50,920
He always makes our cosplays, though.

405
00:18:50,920 --> 00:18:51,920
Yeah.

406
00:18:52,920 --> 00:18:53,920
Oh, wait a sec!

407
00:18:53,920 --> 00:18:56,920
Were you planning on doing both since Hana asked you guys to help out with the interior design?

408
00:18:56,920 --> 00:18:57,920
Come on, man!

409
00:18:58,920 --> 00:19:00,920
I mean, an extra pair of hands would be awesome,

410
00:19:00,920 --> 00:19:02,920
but you're not some kind of superhuman.

411
00:19:02,920 --> 00:19:03,920
Don't overdo it.

412
00:19:03,920 --> 00:19:04,920
The strange man has a point.

413
00:19:04,920 --> 00:19:07,920
None of us think making an outfit is easy.

414
00:19:07,920 --> 00:19:09,920
You don't have time to spare.

415
00:19:09,920 --> 00:19:10,920
Just leave it to us.

416
00:19:10,920 --> 00:19:12,920
I can try to do both.

417
00:19:12,920 --> 00:19:13,920
Seriously?

418
00:19:13,920 --> 00:19:14,920
That's amazing!

419
00:19:14,920 --> 00:19:15,920
You're the best!

420
00:19:15,920 --> 00:19:16,920
Hey!

421
00:19:16,920 --> 00:19:18,920
Gojo, be honest.

422
00:19:18,920 --> 00:19:20,920
You know doing both would wear you out, right?

423
00:19:20,920 --> 00:19:21,920
Just say so.

424
00:19:23,920 --> 00:19:24,920
Yeah.

425
00:19:24,920 --> 00:19:25,920
See?

426
00:19:25,920 --> 00:19:27,920
So just leave it to us, okay, bro?

427
00:19:27,920 --> 00:19:29,920
But you've actually got to speak up.

428
00:19:29,920 --> 00:19:32,920
I mean, if you say it's fine, this guy will take it at face value,

429
00:19:32,920 --> 00:19:33,920
cause he's stupid.

430
00:19:33,920 --> 00:19:34,920
Ouch.

431
00:19:34,920 --> 00:19:35,920
But he's right.

432
00:19:35,920 --> 00:19:38,920
You just focus on the cosplay and we'll take care of everything here.

433
00:19:38,920 --> 00:19:40,920
Let's all get first place together.

434
00:19:40,920 --> 00:19:44,920
And then that leaves us who pretty much can't help anyone with any of it!

435
00:19:44,920 --> 00:19:45,920
I know, right?

436
00:19:45,920 --> 00:19:48,920
I feel like I would immediately screw up the sewing machine.

437
00:19:48,920 --> 00:19:51,920
You're basically a god for even knowing how to work with sewing machines.

438
00:19:51,920 --> 00:19:52,920
I mean, I could try helping with something else.

439
00:19:52,920 --> 00:19:54,920
All this because I know how to use a sewing machine?

440
00:19:54,920 --> 00:19:56,920
Remember when we made aprons as kids?

441
00:19:56,920 --> 00:19:58,920
I wanted to die.

442
00:19:58,920 --> 00:20:00,920
I couldn't figure the sewing machine out.

443
00:20:00,920 --> 00:20:02,920
Well, you're on Team Doofus with me?

444
00:20:02,920 --> 00:20:05,920
Basically, we should all be doing our best to support each other.

445
00:20:05,920 --> 00:20:07,920
Remember what Hana-chan said?

446
00:20:07,920 --> 00:20:10,920
You're the only one who can make the outfit, Gojo.

447
00:20:10,920 --> 00:20:11,920
She's right.

448
00:20:11,920 --> 00:20:14,920
But we might need some help carrying the heavier pieces.

449
00:20:14,920 --> 00:20:15,920
So we'll count on you then.

450
00:20:15,920 --> 00:20:16,920
Right.

451
00:20:16,920 --> 00:20:20,920
Though, if you find you're too busy, it's totally fine to say no.

452
00:20:20,920 --> 00:20:22,920
By the way, where's Mari?

453
00:20:22,920 --> 00:20:23,920
Oh, she's out buying materials.

454
00:20:23,920 --> 00:20:24,920
What?!

455
00:20:24,920 --> 00:20:27,920
You left that up to Mari?!

456
00:20:27,920 --> 00:20:28,920
No way!

457
00:20:28,920 --> 00:20:30,920
We screwed it!

458
00:20:30,920 --> 00:20:32,920
We're not coming back from this!

459
00:20:32,920 --> 00:20:34,920
Okay...

460
00:20:34,920 --> 00:20:36,920
Gojo!

461
00:20:36,920 --> 00:20:39,920
For real though, we're counting on you!

462
00:20:39,920 --> 00:20:41,920
Do your best, dude!

463
00:20:41,920 --> 00:20:42,920
Yeah!

464
00:20:42,920 --> 00:20:44,920
You got it!

465
00:20:44,920 --> 00:20:45,920
Gojo?

466
00:20:45,920 --> 00:20:46,920
What's up?

467
00:20:46,920 --> 00:20:47,920
Kitagawa!

468
00:20:47,920 --> 00:20:48,920
Where are you right now?

469
00:20:48,920 --> 00:20:49,920
Right now?

470
00:20:49,920 --> 00:20:50,920
I'm almost to the station.

471
00:20:50,920 --> 00:20:51,920
Got it!

472
00:20:51,920 --> 00:20:52,920
Wait right there, alright?

473
00:20:52,920 --> 00:20:54,920
I'll go with you!

474
00:20:54,920 --> 00:20:55,920
Hello, Wakuna.

475
00:20:55,920 --> 00:20:56,920
You're pretty chipper today.

476
00:20:56,920 --> 00:20:57,920
Did something happen?

477
00:20:57,920 --> 00:20:58,920
Nope, not at all!

478
00:20:58,920 --> 00:20:59,920
I'm totally the same as usual!

479
00:20:59,920 --> 00:21:00,920
Hmm?

480
00:21:00,920 --> 00:21:01,920
Making a host suit, huh?

481
00:21:01,920 --> 00:21:05,920
For this, I'm thinking of fabric without a pattern, but something with a little bit of glossy finish to it.

482
00:21:05,920 --> 00:21:06,920
It's probably quite similar to a suit, huh?

483
00:21:06,920 --> 00:21:07,920
What's up?

