Did something happen?

495
00:21:18,920 --> 00:21:19,920
Nope, not at all!

496
00:21:19,920 --> 00:21:20,920
I'm totally the same as usual!

497
00:21:20,920 --> 00:21:21,920
Hmm?

498
00:21:21,920 --> 00:21:22,920
Making a host suit, huh?

499
00:21:22,920 --> 00:21:25,920
It's probably quite similar to a suit you'd wear to a party.

500
00:21:25,920 --> 00:21:29,920
In that case, how about this matte satin?

501
00:21:29,920 --> 00:21:34,920
It looks high class, but in an elegant, understated kind of way.

502
00:21:34,920 --> 00:21:35,920
Wow, it's gorgeous!

503
00:21:35,920 --> 00:21:36,920
Wow!

504
00:21:36,920 --> 00:21:39,920
This is seriously on point!

505
00:21:39,920 --> 00:21:43,920
We have a few options here, but I warn you, none of them are cheap.

506
00:21:43,920 --> 00:21:46,920
I've been working my butt off at my job, so we'll be totally fine!

507
00:21:46,920 --> 00:21:47,920
Gotta be that one!

508
00:21:47,920 --> 00:21:48,920
It's just too perfect!

509
00:21:48,920 --> 00:21:50,920
Sure thing!

510
00:21:50,920 --> 00:21:52,920
Oh my gosh!

511
00:21:52,920 --> 00:21:55,920
It has Reisama written all over it!

512
00:21:55,920 --> 00:21:57,920
I think you're right about that!

513
00:21:57,920 --> 00:22:00,920
It's not too fancy, but it's still shiny!

514
00:22:00,920 --> 00:22:01,920
It captures the...

